{"sequence":22,"timestamp":"2026-05-02T02:10:51.189571346Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-1-aa5e9948","body":"frozenkrill-core/src/secret_sharing.rs:365-378: `verify_vsss_share_pair` parses the secret and blinder shares and then calls `verify_share_and_blinder` without first checking that their typed identifiers match. The stricter combine path does reject mismatches in `verified_unique_share_pairs` at frozenkrill-core/src/secret_sharing.rs:640-648, but this helper is used for `verified_inputs` and metadata voting at frozenkrill-core/src/secret_sharing.rs:1180, 1200, 1247, and 1264. Because the vsss verifier evaluates with the secret share's identifier, a structurally invalid pair with a tampered blinder identifier can be treated as verified for metadata even though it would not contribute to reconstruction. Mirror the identifier equality check in `verify_vsss_share_pair` before calling `verify_share_and_blinder`.","classification":"fix_current_bead","dedup_key":"9a354691c426bc86240f25dec1731582a93a1425d0d7daaebb47869293608fbd","reviewer_sources":[{"backend_family":"codex","model_id":"gpt-5.5-xhigh","reviewer_id":"reviewer-1"}],"run_id":"run-20260502013456","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
